stream
BT /F2 20 Tf 56 790 Td (Installation & Field Guide) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 766 Td (RoadLenz Intelligent Mobility  |  Powered by Bigfox Engineering Private Limited) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 750 Td () Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 56 726 Td (Scope) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 706 Td (This document covers the standard field installation procedure for RoadLenz hardware.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 692 Td (Always follow vehicle manufacturer guidance and local electrical safety rules.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 676 Td () Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 56 656 Td (Before you begin) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 636 Td (•  Confirm the part number against the packing list and order.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 621 Td (•  Verify vehicle make, model, year and battery rating.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 606 Td (•  Prepare the toolkit: wire strippers, crimpers, multimeter, zip ties, heat shrink.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 591 Td (•  Confirm network coverage at the installation site.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 560 Td () Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 56 540 Td (Procedure) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 520 Td (1.  Identify the MDVR terminal block: BAT, IGN, GND, ACC-12, GPS+, GPS-.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 503 Td (2.  Connect BAT to the vehicle battery positive through a 5 A fuse \(10 cm max lead\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 486 Td (3.  Connect GND to a clean chassis ground away from EMI sources.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 469 Td (4.  Connect ACC-12 to an ignition-switched 12 V feed for start/stop detection.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 452 Td (5.  Route the GPS antenna cable to the roof location; keep it away from the 4G antenna \(min. 15 cm\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 435 Td (6.  Connect camera channels 1–8 per the channel map: 1 front, 2 rear, 3–4 sides, 5–8 cargo.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 418 Td (7.  Verify all channels show live video in the app before closing the enclosure.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 401 Td (8.  Tie and dress all wiring with zip ties every 15 cm; no dangling cables near pedals.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 280 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 270 Td (Demo sample content — replace with verified documentation before launch.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 250 Td (support@roadlenz.in  |  www.roadlenz.in) Tj ET
